<h1>Deploy the Cloud edition, step by step</h1>
<p class="lede">The exact path used to put this app on Cloudflare for free, in order, including every surprise along the way. Follow it top to bottom and you will have your own instance.</p>

<div class="callout info"><span class="callout-title">Time and cost</span>About 45 minutes the first time. Cost: zero (Cloudflare Workers Free, D1 Free, Atlassian developer console). You need a Cloudflare account and an Atlassian account.</div>

<h2>The plan</h2>
<script type="application/json" class="diagram" data-kind="flow" data-caption="Order matters: the Worker URL is needed for the Atlassian callback, and the client id/secret are needed for sign-in.">
{"w": 840, "h": 260,
